{"id":"wb-1-110","name":"智化寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"智化寺","text":"智化寺，是一座由明代太监王振在正统八年（1443年）创建于北京的汉传佛教寺院。北京文博交流馆于1992年成立于该寺院原址，以期作为北京地区博物馆与民间文物收藏家之间的交流平台等。其所在地现址为北京市东城区禄米仓胡同5号。\n该寺院的明代木结构建筑群等保存完整，是北京市当前少见同类案例之一。该寺院于1961年被公布为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92033341,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92033341","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7694fd46cb110b54db5301ba.jpg","title":"智化门.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%99%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%97%A8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/%E6%99%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%97%A8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Patrick20242023","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"智华寺智化门","width":320,"height":252}}